comment.narrative:
PSD 3a: Number of strengthened organizations for a sustainable business climate. Distinguish between 1) Government 2) Semi-government and 3) Other;

14 organizations were strengthened for a Sustainable business climate: government: 
Alcaldía de Pereira, CARDER, Área Metropolitana Centro Occidente; Semi-government: Aguas y Aguas de Pereira, Empresa de Energía de Pereira, SENA, EDUP; Education: Universidad Tecnológica de Pereira, Universidad Católica, Fundación Salado de Consotá; Civil society: RUTA 4, Edgar Velasco, Other: VNG International.
